  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-TSHoYYrJ\" id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\">使用场景</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-90SLxAk6\">代理商需要定时获取有消耗的广告主的消耗报表信息</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BbaFEW18\" id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\">解决思路</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-1ESooauD\">通过创建一个定时的监控脚本，监控代理商账户下所有有消耗的adv账户消耗情况，以adv账户维度累计消耗，过滤出需要关注的消耗指标，向企业IM群（如飞书群）发送通知。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Uim55PH3\">由于飞书群消息卡片长度限制，本示例代码仅会每次最多推送50条，并多次推送，以完成所有数据推送。</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22692px%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%8B%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%90%91%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9AIM%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%200.%20%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%5Cnconst%20CONFIG%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BE%9D%E7%85%A7%20https%3A%2F%2Fopen.feishu.cn%2Fdocument%2Fclient-docs%2Fbot-v3%2Fadd-custom-bot%20%E5%9C%A8%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20webhook%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%A1%AB%E8%87%B3%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%5Cn%20%20webHookURL%3A%20''%2C%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20checkConfig()%3B%5Cn%20%20console.log('%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B')%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%201.%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E5%8F%AF%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6